nd Little Ones® Infant five-piece musical gift sets</title><link>https://globalrecalls.oecd.org/#/recalls/http%3A%2F%2FPoliciesApplications.oecd.org%2FGlobalRecalls%2FRecall%2FEN%2FUS%2F99009</link><description>The xylophones are mostly white with a red button and yellow handle. The metal bars on the xylophones are red, yellow, green and blue, and the mallets are red. The individually sold xylophones have stickers on them reading, "PLAYWELL. . . SOUND TOY SERIES." Their packaging reads, "Music World Xylophone . . . Playwell . . . Item No: 044073." The three-piece Little OnesTM Infant musical gift sets consist of a toy xylophone and mallet, an accordion and a tambourine. The five-piece set consists of a xylophone, tambourine, harmonica and two maracas. All the instruments are multi-colored plastic. The sets are packaged in a box that reads, in part, "Little OnesTM Infant . . . Ages 6 Months and over . . . Hours of musical fun!" Each musical instrument has "MADE IN CHINA" printed on it.</description><dcterms:creator>United States</dcterms:creator><dcterms:dateSubmitted>1998-10-15</dcterms:dateSubmitted><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 18:03:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">http://PoliciesApplications.oecd.org/GlobalRecalls/Recall/EN/US/99009</guid></item><item><title>Omega brand fire sprinklers</title><link>https://globalrecalls.oecd.org/#/recalls/http%3A%2F%2FPoliciesApplications.oecd.org%2FGlobalRecalls%2FRecall%2FEN%2FUS%2F99008</link><description>The recall of the Omega sprinklers includes models referred to or marked as follows: - C1 (or C-1) - C1A (or C-1A) - C-1A PRO (or C1-A PRO) - C1-A PRO QR - EC-20 - EC-20A - R-1 - R-1A - R-1M - Flow Control (FC, Flow Control-FC) - Protector-M or M Protector (Upright, Pendent, Sidewall, Sidewall EC) - HEC-12 - EC-12 RES - HEC-12 EC - HEC-12 EC PRO - HEC-12 ID - HEC-12 PRO - HEC-12 PRO QR - HEC-20 - Prohibitor QR and AC</description><dcterms:creator>United States</dcterms:creator><dcterms:dateSubmitted>1998-10-14</dcterms:dateSubmitted><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:03:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">http://PoliciesApplications.oecd.org/GlobalRecalls/Recall/EN/US/99008</guid></item><item><title>Children's Teva sandals</title><link>https://globalrecalls.oecd.org/#/recalls/http%3A%2F%2FPoliciesApplications.oecd.org%2FGlobalRecalls%2FRecall%2FEN%2FUS%2F99007</link><description>These Teva sandals have straps that are "Abstract Bright," which are red, blue and yellow; "Abstract Pink," which are pink, purple, black and white; and "Frog Blue," which are blue, white and black. The footbed of the sandals are black. The bottom of the sole is marked with a star pattern along with the words "Teva" and "made in U.S.A." The shoes were packaged in a plastic box. Writing on the paper label inside the box includes, "Little Kids...Teva ... MADE FOR LITTLE FEET." The sandals were sold in sizes 2/3 through 8/9 for children aged 6 months to 4 years.</description><dcterms:creator>United States</dcterms:creator><dcterms:dateSubmitted>1998-10-08</dcterms:dateSubmitted><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 23:24:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">http://PoliciesApplications.oecd.org/GlobalRecalls/Recall/EN/US/99007</guid></item><item><title>"Splash Club" Deluxe Baby Floats</title><link>https://globalrecalls.oecd.org/#/recalls/http%3A%2F%2FPoliciesApplications.oecd.org%2FGlobalRecalls%2FRecall%2FEN%2FUS%2F99006</link><description>The Deluxe Inflatable Kiddie Boats are vinyl and consist of an orange inflatable circular tube with blue handles and a seat in the middle. The boats also have an inflatable, clear plastic barbell with various colored balls inside attached to the front of the boat. Writing on the boat includes, "KIDDIE BOAT . . INTRODUCES YOUR CHILD TO WATER . . . SPLASH CLUB," and has a picture of a dolphin jumping through a hoop. The boxes in which the boats were packaged are labeled with UPC Code 016438897204 or 016438100205 and Kmart Code 372954-115, located just above the price.</description><dcterms:creator>United States</dcterms:creator><dcterms:dateSubmitted>1998-10-08</dcterms:dateSubmitted><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 20:17:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">http://PoliciesApplications.oecd.org/GlobalRecalls/Recall/EN/US/99006</guid></item><item><title>Husqvarna Cross Country dirt bikes</title><link>https://globalrecalls.oecd.org/#/recalls/http%3A%2F%2FPoliciesApplications.oecd.org%2FGlobalRecalls%2FRecall%2FEN%2FAU%2FPS1135052</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Cross Country dirt bikes with BRAKTEC rear brake system.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Affected model variants:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;TX300&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;FX350&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Model years 2022 – 2024&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;Please see attached list of affected VINs.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;These motorbikes are not road-registerable.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dcterms:creator>Australia</dcterms:creator><dcterms:dateSubmitted>2026-08-27</dcterms:dateSubmitted><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:01:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">http://PoliciesApplications.oecd.org/GlobalRecalls/Recall/EN/AU/PS1135052</guid></item><item><title>GASGAS Motocross and Cross Country motorbikes (MY21-24)</title><link>https://globalrecalls.oecd.org/#/recalls/http%3A%2F%2FPoliciesApplications.oecd.org%2FGlobalRecalls%2FRecall%2FEN%2FAU%2FPS1135050</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Full-sized MX motocross and Cross Country models with BRAKTEC rear brake system.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;2-stroke and 4-stroke models&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;MC and EX models variants&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Model years 2021 – 2024&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;Please see attached list of affected VINs.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;These motorbikes are not road-registerable.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dcterms:creator>Australia</dcterms:creator><dcterms:dateSubmitted>2026-08-27</dcterms:dateSubmitted><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:01:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">http://PoliciesApplications.oecd.org/GlobalRecalls/Recall/EN/AU/PS1135050</guid></item><item><title>Basco BFO-15671 oil filter for diesel engines</title><link>https://globalrecalls.oecd.org/#/recalls/http%3A%2F%2FPoliciesApplications.oecd.org%2FGlobalRecalls%2FRecall%2FEN%2FAU%2FPS1135115</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Spin-on engine oil filter for diesel engines, sold as both a standalone part and as part of service kits. Suitable for the following vehicles:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Isuzu D-Max (TFR/TFS series, 06/2012-2026)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Isuzu MU-X (UCS85, 11/2013-06/2021)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Isuzu MU-X (UCR40/UCS40, 07/2021-2026)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Mazda BT50 (B30 TFR40/TFS40, 08/2020-2026) with 3.0L diesel 4JJ1-TCX or 4JJ3-TCX engines&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;Standalone oil filter (sold at Basco Wholesale and Allied Auto Online):&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Part number BFO-15671 (found on packaging and filter can)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Barcode 9356247149707&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;Filter service kit containing affected oil filter (sold at Bunnings Warehouse):&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Kit number BUNF5&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Barcode 9356247157535&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</description><dcterms:creator>Australia</dcterms:creator><dcterms:dateSubmitted>2026-08-27</dcterms:dateSubmitted><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:01:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">http://PoliciesApplications.oecd.org/GlobalRecalls/Recall/EN/AU/PS1135115</guid></item></channel></rss>
